{"work":"ggs","version":"ggs-gurmukhi","book":"raag-soohee","chapter":13,"title":"Ang 740","verses":[
{"v":"1","t":"ਸੂਹੀ ਮਹਲਾ ੫ ॥"},
{"v":"2","t":"ਰਹਣੁ ਨ ਪਾਵਹਿ ਸੁਰਿ ਨਰ ਦੇਵਾ ॥"},
